    "text": "<p>In the given reactions identify the reagent <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi></math> and reagent <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi></math></p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/e1b6e7ac-38c9-4817-830a-ed2a35dcf8eb.png\" style=\"width: 600px; height: 179px;\"/>",
